        "TileImage": "$($repository 76d21419-5f8a-4fe6-b3a5-7be58a87ffc8).Image",
        "Description": "The ICA has accepted a contract regarding a decade‑old concealed crime.\r \rThree women orchestrated a fatal incident at a public concert, disguised as equipment failure. They avoided legal punishment through influence and connections, and fled to Sapienza under new identities.\r \rYears of unpunished arrogance and selfishness have left them completely unrepentant.\r \r47, infiltrate the town. Eliminate the three sisters. Conclude the contract.",
